          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A blacklisted address has a new connection" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "黑名單中的位址有新連線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A favorite host has a new connection" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最愛的主機有新連線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A matching request or response is collected whole and handed to the script's onRequest(request) or onResponse(request, response). A request has method, path, headers and body; a response has status, headers and body. Headers are a list of [name, value] pairs, so repeated ones like Set-Cookie stay apart. The body is the text, decoded, or null when it isn't text; null sends it on as it came. Edit the object or return a new one; returning nothing sends on the one given, edits included. A script that throws or runs past 5 seconds leaves the message as it came, and the inspector says why. Scripts run before breakpoints, which then show the script's edit. Patterns work as in Map Local, and the first match runs. Scripts can't reach the network or files, and keep nothing between runs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "符合的請求或回應會完整收齊後，交給腳本的 onRequest(request) 或 onResponse(request, response)。請求有 method、path、headers 和 body；回應有 status、headers 和 body。headers 是 [name, value] 配對的列表，因此像 Set-Cookie 這類重複的標頭會分開保留。body 是解碼後的文字，不是文字時為 null；設為 null 則照原樣送出。你可以修改該物件或回傳新的物件；不回傳任何值則送出原物件，包含你的修改。腳本拋出例外或執行超過 5 秒時，訊息會照原樣送出，檢閱器會說明原因。腳本在中斷點之前執行，中斷點會顯示腳本修改後的內容。樣式的用法與 Map Local 相同，並執行第一個符合的腳本。腳本無法存取網路或檔案，每次執行之間也不會保留任何資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A matching request waits before it goes to the server, and a matching response before it goes back to the app, for you to edit or abort in the Requests inspector. Patterns work as in Map Local, but every matching rule applies. The app waits too, and most give up after a minute." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "符合的請求會在送往伺服器前、符合的回應會在送回 App 前暫停，讓你在「請求」的檢閱器中編輯或中止。樣式的用法與 Map Local 相同，但所有符合的規則都會套用。App 也會跟著等待，多數 App 約一分鐘後就會放棄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A request whose URL matches gets the file as its response, read fresh each time; the server never sees it. * matches anything, a pattern without http:// or https:// covers both, and the first match wins. Only requests WiFiDetect can read are mapped: plain HTTP, and HTTPS for the hosts listed in the Proxy tab. Other HTTPS passes through unread and is never mapped." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "URL 符合的請求會以該檔案作為回應，每次都重新讀取；伺服器不會收到請求。* 可符合任何內容，沒寫 http:// 或 https:// 的樣式兩者皆適用，並以第一個符合的規則為準。只有 WiFiDetect 能讀取的請求才會被對應：純 HTTP，以及「代理伺服器」標籤頁所列主機的 HTTPS。其他 HTTPS 會直接通過、不被讀取，也永遠不會被對應。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A request whose URL matches goes to this server instead, with the same path, query and body; its Host header names the new server. Give http:// or https://, a host and, if it isn't the usual one, a port. Patterns work as in Map Local, only for requests WiFiDetect can read, and the first match wins. A request Map Local answers isn't sent anywhere." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "URL 符合的請求會改送到這台伺服器，路徑、查詢字串與內文不變；其 Host 標頭會改為新的伺服器。請填入 http:// 或 https://、主機，若不是預設連接埠也請填入連接埠。樣式的用法與 Map Local 相同，只適用於 WiFiDetect 能讀取的請求，並以第一個符合的規則為準。已由 Map Local 回應的請求不會被送往任何地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A router sends the layout of its records (a template) every few minutes. Records that arrive before it can't be read; the count stops growing once it comes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "路由器每隔幾分鐘會送出紀錄的格式（範本）。比範本早到的紀錄無法讀取；範本到達後，這個數字就不會再增加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
