          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move WiFiDetect to the Applications folder and open it from there: macOS installs network extensions only from there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請將 WiFiDetect 移到「應用程式」檔案夾，並從那裡打開：macOS 只會從該處安裝網路延伸功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Multicast" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "多點傳送"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "名稱"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name apps with a content filter" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以內容過濾器辨識 App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Names the app behind each new connection, including those URLSession and other Network.framework code open, which the socket table can't see, and the app a system daemon such as nsurlsessiond works for. It never blocks anything: every connection is let through. If the extension stops, the connections it was watching are cut off; new ones go through without it. Connections that started before it was on keep the names they had." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "辨識每個新連線背後的 App，包括 socket 表看不到、由 URLSession 和其他 Network.framework 程式碼開啟的連線，以及 nsurlsessiond 等系統常駐程式代為服務的 App。它從不封鎖任何東西：所有連線都會放行。若延伸功能停止，它正在監看的連線會被中斷；新的連線則會繞過它。在它開啟前就已建立的連線會保留原本的名稱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nearby Networks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "附近的網路"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NetFlow v9" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "NetFlow v9 and IPFIX from routers set to export to this Mac, shown in Traffic › Router Flows. 4739 is IPFIX's registered port; routers often default to 2055 for NetFlow. Listens on every network interface: anything that reaches this Mac on the port can add flows." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接收設為匯出到這台 Mac 的路由器所送出的 NetFlow v9 與 IPFIX，顯示於「流量 › 路由器流量」。4739 是 IPFIX 的註冊連接埠；路由器的 NetFlow 預設常為 2055。會在所有網路介面上監聽：任何能透過此連接埠連到這台 Mac 的來源都能加入流量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Network" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "網路"
          }
        }
      }
    },
