      }
    },
    "One IPv4 or IPv6 address or CIDR range per line, such as 203.0.113.7 or 203.0.113.0/24; text after # or ; is a comment. Connections whose remote address matches are marked Blacklisted in Connections. WiFiDetect doesn't download lists: import one you trust." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每行一個 IPv4 或 IPv6 位址或 CIDR 範圍，例如 203.0.113.7 或 203.0.113.0/24；# 或 ; 之後的文字為註解。遠端位址符合的連線，會在「連線」中標示為「黑名單中」。WiFiDetect 不會下載名單：請輸入你信任的名單。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One host per line; *.example.com covers every subdomain. Other HTTPS passes through unread, and so does Apple's own traffic, which refuses to be decrypted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每行一個主機；*.example.com 涵蓋所有子網域。其他 HTTPS 會直接通過、不被讀取，Apple 自己的流量也是如此，因為它拒絕被解密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
