    "Readings from the last 7 days are kept on this Mac, in ~/Library/Application Support/WiFiDetect/Wi-Fi Readings, so the signal charts pick up where they left off. They hold signal, noise and the time, never the network's name. Traffic and requests aren't kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最近 7 天的讀數會保存在這台 Mac 的 ~/Library/Application Support/WiFiDetect/Wi-Fi Readings，讓訊號圖表能接續先前的紀錄。讀數只包含訊號、雜訊和時間，絕不包含網路名稱。流量與請求不會保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
