    "This Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這台 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac's settings or its management profile don't allow the extension." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這台 Mac 的設定或其管理描述檔不允許此延伸功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build of WiFiDetect doesn't include its network extension, which comes with the Developer ID build; connections are named from the socket table alone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此版本的 WiFiDetect 未包含網路延伸功能（Developer ID 版本才有）；連線只會依 socket 表辨識。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build of WiFiDetect doesn't include its network extension, which comes with the Developer ID build; only apps that use the system proxy reach WiFiDetect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此版本的 WiFiDetect 未包含網路延伸功能（Developer ID 版本才有）；只有使用系統代理伺服器的 App 會經過 WiFiDetect。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a proxy: send it requests with absolute URLs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是代理伺服器：請以絕對 URL 傳送請求。"
