    },
    "To read HTTPS, WiFiDetect makes a certificate authority of its own on this Mac and asks macOS to trust it. Its private key stays in your keychain and never leaves it. Remove it when you're done debugging." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "為了讀取 HTTPS，WiFiDetect 會在這台 Mac 上製作自己的憑證授權單位，並請 macOS 信任它。它的私密金鑰保存在你的鑰匙圈中，永遠不會離開。除錯完成後請將它移除。"
          }
        }
