    "Waiting for approval in Login Items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在等待於登入項目中核准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for you to allow it in System Settings › General › Login Items & Extensions › Network Extensions" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待你在「系統設定 › 一般 › 登入項目與延伸功能 › 網路延伸功能」中允許"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weaker than Poor is Very poor. The Good line is also drawn on the chart as the VoIP and streaming minimum. Chipsets scale RSSI differently, so treat these as guidance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "比「差」更弱即為「極差」。「良好」的最低值也會畫在圖表上，作為 VoIP 與串流的最低要求。不同晶片組的 RSSI 刻度不同，這些數值僅供參考。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where a Mac starts looking for a stronger access point." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac 開始尋找訊號更強的無線基地台的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While the proxy runs, these apps' HTTPS goes to it even if they don't use the system proxy, as curl --noproxy and many Go, Python and Java programs don't. Helpers inside an app come with it. Their QUIC is refused so they fall back to TCP; plain HTTP on port 80 isn't captured. If WiFiDetect quits or its proxy stops answering, they connect directly again. WiFiDetect itself is never captured." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "代理伺服器執行時，這些 App 的 HTTPS 即使不使用系統代理伺服器也會送往它，例如 curl --noproxy 以及許多 Go、Python、Java 程式。App 內的輔助程式也會一併擷取。它們的 QUIC 會被拒絕，因而改用 TCP；連接埠 80 上的純 HTTP 不會被擷取。若 WiFiDetect 結束或其代理伺服器停止回應，它們會恢復直接連線。WiFiDetect 本身永遠不會被擷取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
