    "macOS blocked local network access. Allow WiFiDetect in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network, then turn sharing off and on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 封鎖了區域網路存取。請在「系統設定 › 隱私權與安全性 › 區域網路」中允許 WiFiDetect，然後關閉再重新開啟分享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS is set not to show WiFiDetect's notifications. Allow them in System Settings › Notifications › WiFiDetect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 目前設定為不顯示 WiFiDetect 的通知。請在「系統設定 › 通知 › WiFiDetect」中允許。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS shows network names and BSSIDs only to apps with location access. WiFiDetect doesn't use where you are." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
